> - The QC height increment form for 14.3, since from measured stand lists 0.111 stalls top height and 1.242 lets it rise to 1.5 times ESI and still climbing at 100 years (PREREG44). PREREG37 already shows why: on field tags observed over predicted increment falls from 1.655 below HT/ESI 0.5 to 0.523 at 1 to 1.25, while the coded `dht` has no relative height term. A PREREG45 draft proposes a relative height multiplier and awaits a decision to open 14.3 work.
